    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Zombie Tide is a third-person survival shooting game that combines survivor and RPG. How long can you examine in front of an endless tide of corpses? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. Zombie drop system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain more powerful and higher-quality weapons by continuously killing endless zombies. Develop a survival strategy, save supplies dropped by zombies, and use them at the right time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bullets dropped by zombies to avoid being surrounded by zombies with an empty magazine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Backpack system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand your weapons more intuitively so that you can deal with the zombie army more skillfully. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your backpack so you have room for your favorite weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Subsequent updates </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drops that are more conducive to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More types of firearms.</p>",
